vid Cronenberg, ZAAM features a spine-tingling atmosphere that complements the story perfectly, keeping you on the edge of your seat.<br>  <br>  </li><li> <strong>Puzzle-Solving Elements:</strong> You will be challenged by light but intriguing puzzles as they unravel the truth behind Lucy's disappearance.<br>  <br>  </li><li> <strong>Short Playtime with a Lasting Impact:</strong> Experience the gripping tale of ZAAM in just about an hour and a half, and be prepared for an emotional rollercoaster ride that will leave a lasting impact on you.<br>  </li></ul>",
